text:
3 iconic soul food restaurants in Harlem that are a must visit. 
@sylviasrestaurant has been around for years visited by multiple celebrities and presidents throughout its run. People enjoy their fried chicken, candied yams, and mac and cheese 

@melbasharlem is the modern hip restaurant that draws in both the young and older generation putting a modern twist on this cuisine with dishes like spring rolls stuffed with collard greens and cheddar. My fave is the egg nog waffle with southern fried chicken 

@charlespanfriedchicken arguably has the best fried chicken in NYC. It’s flavor is unmatched and there’s a reasons people trying there from other boroughs to try this viral fried chicken. 

#harlem #soulfood #friedchicken #chickenandwaffles #comfortfood

